post.summary:
The caller agrees that this is their own voice. `line` must be the words
`GET /me/voice-intro` served (`409 voice_consent_line_changed` otherwise);
they are stored with the time.

scheduledFor.description:
The start of the hour the person picked, exactly as `GET
/legal/consultation/slots` gave it. Required for a video or phone call;
an in-person consultation is arranged directly and books no hour.

xHandle.description:
The rest of where a creator can be reached. Handles are short strings;
the three URL fields take a full link, validated as one so a profile
cannot publish something that will not open.
